# tcrsift canonical TCR constant-region AA sequences
# Source: Ensembl release 110 protein_sequence for each canonical transcript
# Verified against UniProt P01848 (TRAC), P01850 (TRBC1), A0A5B9 (TRBC2)
#
# All three sequences are stored as BARE MATURE protein, matching the
# UniProt chain annotations exactly. No synthetic residue is prepended.
# The J→C junction residue (universally E for β chains, J-dependent
# N/Y/D/H for α chains) is read per-clone from the CellRanger contig at
# assembly time — see _add_constant_regions in assemble.py and #105.
# Pre-2.0 versions baked a synthetic E into the stored TRBC1/TRBC2.
#
# To regenerate this file:
#   python -m tcrsift._regen_canonical_constants
